{"name": "Traks", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In <strong>Traks</strong> you can <strong>build</strong> your own races and <strong>share</strong> them with your friends. In this <strong>physics based racing game</strong> the focus isn't just <strong>pure speed</strong>, but to ride the <strong>custom made tracks</strong> that you and your friends can <strong>create and share</strong> with each other with just a <strong>simple text message</strong>. Ever expanding <strong>customizable and upgradable cars</strong> that you can feel. An extensive variety of <strong>premade tracks</strong> to compete. <strong>Minigames</strong>, Global and local <strong>leader boards</strong>, and never before seen <strong>game modes</strong>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traks is a solodev freetime love project inspired by the 90's retro games like Stunts, Re-Volt, Terep2 (Deformers)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4933470/extras_big/9f52227843812aae0848d4b001fe604c.webp?t=1790423376\" height=\"125\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4933470/extras/9f52227843812aae0848d4b001fe604c.avif?t=1790423376\" width=\"1560\"/></span>Tear through <strong>different unique tracks</strong>, each with its own distinct atmosphere:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lakehouse</strong> - A technical, lakeside forest track packed with sharp turns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Professional Racetrack</strong> - Master the curves of a classic circuit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Urban City</strong> - Carve through diverse urban districts with skyscrapers and a massive docked ship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Space Track</strong> - Defy gravity in an otherworldly racing experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Western Canyons</strong> - A canyon circuit featuring a steam train, an ancient village, and a mystical cavern.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And much more to come...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4933470/extras/5563a5b0bf2d9999c791ef8baefbae43.poster.avif?t=1790423376\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4933470/extras/5563a5b0bf2d9999c791ef8baefbae43.webm?t=1790423376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4933470/extras/5563a5b0bf2d9999c791ef8baefbae43.mp4?t=1790423376\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4933470/extras_big/003c904d65897ac2e5272d67939ecbe5.webp?t=1790423376\" height=\"125\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4933470/extras/003c904d65897ac2e5272d67939ecbe5.avif?t=1790423376\" width=\"1560\"/></span>Choose from <strong>more different vehicles</strong> and make them truly yours:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Visual Customization:</strong> Paint jobs, textures, spoilers, and bumpers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Performance Tuning:</strong> Adjust steering angle, drivetrain (FWD/RWD), wheel types and sizes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Instant Testing:</strong> The main menu doubles as a test track for immediate setup verification.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4933470/extras/ed2ddc0d946e8e15fbd6c1b0b462cc9a.poster.avif?t=1790423376\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4933470/extras/ed2ddc0d946e8e15fbd6c1b0b462cc9a.webm?t=1790423376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4933470/extras/ed2ddc0d946e8e15fbd6c1b0b462cc9a.mp4?t=1790423376\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4933470/extras_big/306a13dd9bf1f1656089874fe1d0bf7f.webp?t=1790423376\" height=\"125\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4933470/extras/306a13dd9bf1f1656089874fe1d0bf7f.avif?t=1790423376\" width=\"1560\"/></span>Unleash your creativity with the <strong>intuitive block-based editor</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>367x357x72 grid system</strong> for massive track possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple scenic <strong>environments</strong> to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different <strong>road types</strong> (with more coming soon).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Linear</strong> building system with <strong>keyboard</strong> support for <strong>rapid construction</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Modifiable blocks</strong> - click any placed block to edit them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Easy sharing</strong> - Export and import tracks using <strong>simple text code</strong> that work via <strong>any messaging platform</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4933470/extras/b8e2ba856e411e771ccd13f48ac059a7.poster.avif?t=1790423376\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4933470/extras/b8e2ba856e411e771ccd13f48ac059a7.webm?t=1790423376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4933470/extras/b8e2ba856e411e771ccd13f48ac059a7.mp4?t=1790423376\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4933470/extras_big/c80715cdbccb34224f6cc800798e3602.webp?t=1790423376\" height=\"125\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4933470/extras/c80715cdbccb34224f6cc800798e3602.avif?t=1790423376\" width=\"1560\"/></span>Race with friends <strong>locally</strong> and <strong>online</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Local multiplayer</strong> for face-to-face challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Online multiplayer</strong> for global competition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Split-screen</strong> mode currently in development.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>AI opponents:</strong> Race against up to 20 bots across 4 difficulty levels (Easy, Normal, Hard, Extreme).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local and Global <strong>leader boards</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Text and <strong>Proximity voice chat</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"720\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4933470/extras/ec572aebf1d714d2983fe6b1939c54c3.avif?t=1790423376\" width=\"1280\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4933470/extras_big/3e95296b09411bff0162bb88a5eb8e8b.webp?t=1790423376\" height=\"125\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4933470/extras/3e95296b09411bff0162bb88a5eb8e8b.avif?t=1790423376\" width=\"1560\"/></span>Beyond traditional racing:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Classic Race:</strong> Pure speed competition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bunny Hunt:</strong> Explore each track to find 10 hidden bunnies and unlock exclusive customization options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More exciting <strong>never before seen</strong> modes in active development...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4933470/extras/b14a441a5e22e8e91cd852230617fde4.poster.avif?t=1790423376\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4933470/extras/b14a441a5e22e8e91cd852230617fde4.webm?t=1790423376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4933470/extras/b14a441a5e22e8e91cd852230617fde4.mp4?t=1790423376\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">From <strong>precision time trials</strong> down to the millisecond, to just <strong>building and styling</strong> your dream ride, this game offers <strong>endless entertainment</strong> with its combination of <strong>tight racing mechanics</strong>, powerful <strong>creation tools</strong> and <strong>sharing capabilities</strong>. <strong>Build</strong> your dream track, <strong>tune</strong> your perfect car and <strong>challenge the world!</strong></h2> </div>", "short_desc": "Race, Build, Customize, Share! Physics based racing game featuring diverse tracks, extensive car customization, and a powerful intuitive block-based track editor with simple text-message sharing. Race solo against bots, compete online, or build and share your own tracks with friends!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4933470/45d65862f5588e5ec61edcb08c7c5f8cf30c49a1/header.jpg?t=1790423376", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Racing", "Simulation", "Level Editor", "Automobile Sim", "Building", "Immersive Sim"], "developers": "Gabor Alberti", "publishers": "Gabor Alberti", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4933470", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "28 September 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/0TOpy-V4fO8", "first_seen": 1790546400.0, "review_rank": 14}